# Uncork wine-macos-build patch 0003 — define SONAME_LIBVULKAN under --without-vulkan
#
# WHY: CrossOver's dlls/win32u/vulkan.c ("CW HACK 25909") references SONAME_LIBVULKAN
# unconditionally, but configuring with --without-vulkan leaves it #undef'd in
# config.h, so win32u.so fails to compile:
#   win32u/vulkan.c: use of undeclared identifier 'SONAME_LIBVULKAN'
# win32u.so is a hard dependency of winemac.so, so the whole graphics driver fails.
# We don't use Vulkan for the CEF/DXMT path, so a harmless value is fine.
#
# ACTION (post-configure): in the build tree's include/config.h, replace
#   /* #undef SONAME_LIBVULKAN */
# with
#   #define SONAME_LIBVULKAN "libvulkan.1.dylib"
# (build-engine.sh does this automatically after ./configure when --without-vulkan.)
#
# APPLIES TO: CrossOver-sourced Wine (24.x / 26.x) configured --without-vulkan.
